[00:02.786]There once was a ship that put to sea
{"曾有艘船驶向海洋"}
[00:05.282]The name of the ship was the Billy of Tea
{"船名叫做比利茶号"}
[00:07.864]The winds blew up, her bow dipped down
{"狂风骤起船首低垂"}
[00:10.327]Oh～Blow, my bully boys, blow (Huh!)
[00:13.073]Soon may the Wellerman come
{"惠勒人快些到来吧"}
[00:15.461]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
{"带给我们糖茶与朗姆"}
[00:18.056]One day, when the tonguin' is done
{"待捕鲸工作完成时"}
[00:20.416]We'll take our leave and go
{"我们将启程离开"}
[00:23.040]She'd not been two weeks from shore
{"离岸未满两星期"}
[00:25.337]When down on her a right whale bore
{"露脊鲸便猛然来袭"}
[00:28.027]The captain called all hands and swore
{"船长召集全员发誓"}
[00:30.223]He'd take that whale in tow (Hah!)
{"定要拖回那头鲸（哈！）"}
[00:33.104]Soon may the Wellerman come
{"惠勒人快些到来吧"}
[00:35.432]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
{"带给我们糖茶与朗姆"}
[00:38.029]One day, when the tonguin' is done
{"待捕鲸工作完成时"}
[00:40.376]We'll take our leave and go
{"我们将启程离开"}
[00:43.082]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[00:45.499]Da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da
[00:48.111]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[00:50.435]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[00:52.989]Before the boat had hit the water
{"小艇尚未入水时"}
[00:55.342]The whale's tail came up and caught her
{"鲸尾掀起将其捕获"}
[00:57.914]All hands to the side, harpooned and fought her
{"众人持矛拼死搏斗"}
[01:00.410]When she dived down low (Huh!)
{"当它深潜之时（嘿！）"}
[01:03.053]Soon may the Wellerman come
{"惠勒人快些到来吧"}
[01:05.423]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
{"带给我们糖茶与朗姆"}
[01:08.058]One day, when the tonguin' is done
{"待捕鲸工作完成时"}
[01:10.354]We'll take our leave and go
{"我们将启程离开"}
[01:12.903]No line was cut, no whale was freed;
{"绳索未断鲸未逃脱"}
[01:15.329]The Captain's mind was not of greed
{"船长心中并无贪念"}
[01:17.832]But he belonged to the whaleman's creed;
{"但他遵循捕鲸人的信条"}
[01:20.245]She took that ship in tow (Huh!)
{"她将那船拖入浪涛（哈！）"}
[01:23.002]Soon may the Wellerman come
{"愿惠勒曼早日到来"}
[01:25.372]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
{"为我们捎来糖茶与朗姆"}
[01:28.022]One day, when the tonguin' is done
{"待割取鲸脂的那天终至"}
[01:30.332]We'll take our leave and go
{"我们将启程远航"}
[01:33.050]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[01:35.317]Da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da
[01:38.084]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[01:40.459]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[01:42.657]For forty days, or even more
{"四十余日甚至更久"}
[01:45.231]The line went slack, then tight once more
{"绳索时松时紧"}
[01:47.838]All boats were lost, there were only four
{"仅剩四艘小艇幸存"}
[01:50.344]But still that whale did go
{"但那鲸鱼仍在游弋"}
[01:53.011]Soon may the Wellerman come
{"愿惠勒曼早日到来"}
[01:55.428]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
{"为我们捎来糖茶与朗姆"}
[01:58.076]One day, when the tonguin' is done
{"待割取鲸脂的那天终至"}
[02:00.398]We'll take our leave and go
{"我们将启程远航"}
[02:02.718]As far as I've heard, the fight's still on;
{"据我所闻战斗仍在继续"}
[02:05.126]The line's not cut and the whale's not gone
{"绳索未断鲸鱼未去"}
[02:08.002]The Wellerman makes his regular call
{"惠勒曼按时前来探访"}
[02:10.273]To encourage the Captain, crew, and all
{"鼓舞船长船员众人"}
[02:12.979]Soon may the Wellerman come
{"愿惠勒曼早日到来"}
[02:15.342]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
{"为我们捎来糖茶与朗姆"}
[02:17.976]One day, when the tonguin' is done
{"待割取鲸脂的那天终至"}
[02:20.371]We'll take our leave and go
{"我们将启程远航"}
[02:23.058]Soon may the Wellerman come
{"愿惠勒曼早日到来"}
[02:25.372]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
{"为我们捎来糖茶与朗姆"}
[02:28.013]One day, when the tonguin' is done
{"终有一天 当捕鲸结束"}
[02:30.304]We'll take our leave and go
{"我们将启程远航"}
